-- Curriculum order, approved renames and fixes, and historical class times.
-- Decisions from CHANGE_PROPOSAL_LOG.md items 1-8, approved by Ken on 2026-10-14.
-- Times are India Standard Time (Asia/Kolkata), from Aaron's Apple Calendar export.
-- The two row removals (log 46, the old alternate picking subcategory) are in 20261014c.

-- 1. Exercise order from the curriculum's ExcOrder 1-284. Item ids are unchanged.
